      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/levelupleo/{size}/2394_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-25T03:16:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So far I've gotten 4 of the mini-expansions: Ambuscade, The Final Wasteland, Silver Gulch 1883 and Miss Information. The first 3 had these neat \"title\" cards witha biography on them, but Miss Information did not have one of these cards. I was wondering if her deck doesn't come with one of these cards, or if it was left out by mistake?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(Note: I'm not talking about her character card. I know the game is perfectly playable without it, but for collections sake I might still want it if there is one.)</p>",
