      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-25T06:52:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think that she has one.&nbsp; I'll have to talk to a friend who just bought all of the Sentinels game (ALL of it, save for out-of-print promo cards).&nbsp; As far as I know he should have one for her.&nbsp; I definitely want all of them, too.&nbsp; I have all of the cards in the game, but I only have the bio cards for Ambuscade and Unity.<br><br>EDIT:&nbsp; And having those bios on the cards are quite handy for introducing players to these characters.&nbsp; It's much, much easier telling someone \"Here is Unity!&nbsp; This bio card explains her quite well,\" rather than \"Let me ramble on about this character I like.&nbsp; Did I not do a good job?&nbsp; Let me pull out The Internet and make you read it on my phone/laptop/tablet.\"</p>",
